        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Because of the potential for serious adverse reactions in a breastfed child, advise women not to breastfeed during treatments with allopurinol tablets and for one week after the last dose.",
